Custom Exceptions:

    1. IllegalMoveException

    This exception is thrown when a player attempts to make an illegal move. This includes several scenarios:

    - Invalid move format
    - No piece exists at the source position
    - Attempting to move an opponent's piece
    - Attempting to move to a position occupied by your own piece
    - The move doesn't follow the rules for the specific piece

    2. CheckmateException

    This exception is thrown when a player attempts to make a move that would result in their king being in check (or checkmate).

